   "q_en": "<p>The dimensions of a box are 15 m, X m, and 10 m. If the cost of painting the entire box externally is Rs.2898 at Rs.3 per sq. m, then find the volume (in cubic m) of the box.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2377;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2351;&#2366;&#2350; 15 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352;, X &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2324;&#2352; 10 &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2375; &#2348;&#2377;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360; &#2325;&#2379; &#2348;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2368; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2375;&#2306;&#2335; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; 3 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327; &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; 2898 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2348;&#2377;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2344; (&#2328;&#2344; &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "1828",
    "1998",
    "2108",
    "1746"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "1828",
    "1998",
    "2108",
    "1746"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>Surface area of the box = Total cost of painting/Rate</p><p>= 2898/3 = 966 sq. m</p><p>So,</p><p>2 * (15X + 10X + 150) = 966</p><p>25X = 483  -  150</p><p>25X = 333</p><p>X= 333/25</p><p>X = 13.32</p><p>Now,</p><p>Volume of the box = 15 * 13.32 * 10</p><p>= 15 * 10 * 1332/100</p><p>= 666 * 3 = 1998 cubic m</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Surface area of the box = Total cost of painting/Rate</p><p>= 2898/3 = 966 sq. m</p><p>So,</p><p>2 * (15X + 10X + 150) = 966</p><p>25X = 483  -  150</p><p>25X = 333</p><p>X= 333/25</p><p>X = 13.32</p><p>Now,</p><p>Volume of the box = 15 * 13.32 * 10</p><p>= 15 * 10 * 1332/100</p><p>= 666 * 3 = 1998 cubic m</p>",
   "marks": 1.0,
