   "q_en": "<p>A cuboidal tank of length and width 16m and X m respectively is full of water. When 35.2 kilolitres water is removed from the tank, the level of water goes down by 40 cm. The value of X is:</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 16m &#2324;&#2352; Xm &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2330;&#2380;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2328;&#2344;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2335;&#2376;&#2306;&#2325; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2349;&#2352;&#2366; &#2361;&#2369;&#2310; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2332;&#2348; &#2335;&#2376;&#2306;&#2325; &#2360;&#2375; 35.2 &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2379;&#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2352; 40 cm &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2330;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>",
   "options_en": [
