   "q_en": "<p>The lateral surface area of a cuboid is 216 sq.m. Find the height of the cuboid, if the sum of the adjacent side of its base is 36 m.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2328;&#2344;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357; &#2346;&#2371;&#2359;&#2381;&#2336;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; 216 sq.m. &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2328;&#2344;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2360;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; 36 m &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
