   "q_en": "<p>The breadth of a cuboid is b cm. The length of the cuboid is three times its breadth and the height of the cuboid is the average of its length and breadth. Find the total surface area (in sq. cm) of cuboid.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2328;&#2344;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2368; &#2330;&#2380;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; b cm &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2328;&#2344;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312;, &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2330;&#2380;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2328;&#2344;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2368; &#2314;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312;, &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2330;&#2380;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2366; &#2324;&#2360;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2328;&#2344;&#2366;&#2349; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2346;&#2371;&#2359;&#2381;&#2336;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; (sq. cm &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "12b<sup>2</sup>",
    "22b<sup>2</sup>",
    "16b<sup>2</sup>",
    "28b<sup>2</sup>"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "12b<sup>2</sup>",
    "22b<sup>2</sup>",
