   "solution_en": "<p>Breadth = b cm</p><p>length = 3b cm</p><p>Height = 2b cm</p><p>Total surface area = 2 * (lb+bh +hl) = 2 * (3b<sup>2</sup> + 2b<sup>2</sup> + 6b<sup>2</sup>) = 22b<sup>2</sup> cm<sup>2</sup></p>",
