   "solution_en": "<p>Volume of cube = Volume of cuboid</p><p>X<sup>3</sup> = 15 x 24 x 75</p><p>X<sup>3</sup> = 5 x 3 x 3 x 8 x 5 x 5 x 3</p><p>X = 30 cm</p><p>Lateral surface area of cube = 4 * X<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 4 x 30 x 30</p><p>= 3600 cm<sup>2</sup></p>",
